utility(Scarlet):
    Scarlet learns to trust instincts and be brave. -> score += 1
    Scarlet successfully delivers Basket to Agatha. -> score += 2

utility(Agatha):
    Agatha enjoys Scarlet's company and shares wisdom. -> score += 2
    Agatha outsmarts or escapes the clutches of Grimlock. -> score += 1

utility(Grimlock):
	Trick Scarlet or Agatha to gain an advantage by using charm and deception.
	Capture prey to satisfy hunger, driven by past trauma and survival instincts.
	Maintain a cunning and deceptive facade to manipulate others and the environment.
	Seek opportunities to exert influence and control over the forest and its inhabitants.

## Narrative Goals
utility(narrative):
